      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The previous issue where the Friends List and other user-related information failed to load appears to have been fixed.\n\nHowever, I am now experiencing a different issue on VRChat Mobile. User icons and other user-related information are displayed normally, but tapping a user's icon does not open their profile. Instead, a loading error occurs and the profile cannot be viewed.\n\nExpected:\n\nTapping a user's icon should open their profile and display their user information.\n\nActual:\n\nThe profile does not open and a loading error is displayed.\n\nThis happens when tapping other users' profile icons. The user icon itself is displayed correctly, but the profile fails to load when tapped.",
